# classroom-mcp — Cursor rules

Python 3.12+, `uv run` (never naked `python`). Ruff line-length 100.
MCP tools: `Annotated[..., Field(description=...)]` params, `## Return Format` +
`## Examples` docstrings, dialogic `{success, message}` returns.
Upsert paths narrow `except aiosqlite.IntegrityError` — never bare `except Exception` on inserts.
ASCII-only prose (hyphens, not em dashes).

## Session Context (classroom-mcp)

Before starting work: call `status()` for health, then `student_list()` /
`class_list()` / `course_list()` to ground IDs — never invent row IDs.
Prefer `*_update` by ID over delete-and-recreate (keeps FK relationships).

At end of work: run `just ci` (ruff + format check + pytest); record graded
work with `progress_record()`; summarize counts.
